{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"b06b4bb56cb35ae6c8ccf3dd2adb925da712d6c84371ff823d13c56a992c8290","digest":{"component_or_area":".gitignore / worktree garbage collection","key_entities":[".gitignore",".provision.log",".venv/","__pycache__/",".pytest_cache/",".ruff_cache__/","com.navapbc.rebar-worktree-gc"],"problem_keywords":["gitignore","provisioning artifact","worktree gc","untracked files","provision.log"],"propositions":[".provision.log is written during venv provisioning but not in .gitignore, causing git status --porcelain to be non-empty for the worktree lifetime","untracked .provision.log files pin worktrees permanently by preventing garbage collection due to the \"no uncommitted work\" safety guard","adding .provision.log to .gitignore will allow worktrees to age out and become collectable when idle","the pattern should be unanchored (matching at any directory depth) consistent with existing provisioning artifact patterns like __pycache__/ and *.pyc"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787424865044838001,"uuid":"6f86d135-b219-4b2e-b28f-2faa72f5a10b"}